Just a quick thumbs down, due to an awful state of game as it is now.
From one side: beauteful sandbox (of universe size!) survival game, a bit grindy, but with lots of activities.
From other: it's buggy as hell consolish crap (UI wise).
Initial game release was a fake promise coupled with real lack of content or movivation to play. Now, year later, there is a story, mysterious events leading a player through many aspects of the game... the problem is: it's executed poorly technically.
Game doesn't have a normal MAP, well, it has one, called galaxy map, which is ONLY available on flying in space ship. The important information is split amoung several screens without hotkeys.
Quest window is ugly, you will be bombarded with crap loads of useless info, while the most important is missing, or can be seen in annoying way.
"Press P to see journal".. and P is opening e.g. settings screen or some other random screen.. really.
Pressing TAB will open again random screen (most of times - tool window, no idea why).
Did I mention lack of hotkeys?
Did I mention hardcoded keys? You want to rebind something? You better not or there are consequences...
It's hard to navigate game, given zillions of planets and ugly UI where you can't scroll things with mouse wheel, but have to press with mouse some buttons.
It become very annoying quickly. Guardian planets, where hundereds of guardiands will follow you, constantly spawning behind. They aren't threat, really.. only a huge load of negative emotions. Should a game give ones? I don't know..
---
What this game needs to become really good one, apart from giving it a few years time needed for developing release quality product?
Well:
- map, accessible anywhere, easily navigate-able, with all info I learned or need;
- quest window, good one, not crappy one;
- rework of sentinels planets;
- rework of scanning of environment, introducing delay for a key element is meh;
- rework of scanning of planets, I don't want random crap appears off planet;
- rework of scanning flora/fauna, no more those 200$ things or minerals, no more hours and hours of animal hunting please;
- space combat needs dodge, aka strafe, aka ability to avoid being hit... combat "fly behind enemy, shoot, repeat" - no thanks..
- more hotkeys and no hardcoded keys;
- remove quick menu and quick build menu, currently base building is too much scrolling up and to side.
- e.g. introduce action bar, I don't want to "scroll" to select weapon/tool I need, I don't want to scroll in the middle of combat, or open inventory in the middle of combat;
- rework swimming;
- rework sprint+melee attack+jump+fly combo, all players are using it.. doesn't ring a bell to developer? nope?

